price_scale.description:
The scale factor for the price of the order. To convert the `price` to its actual value, multiply it by this scale factor;

 -  2300 ETH `price` will be entered as `2300.00 * price_scale = 230000`
 -  65000.10 BTC order `price` will be entered as `65000.10 * price_scale = 6500010`.

fractional_quantity_scale.description:
The scale factor for the quantity of the `order_qty` field on order placement. To convert the `order_qty` to its actual value, multiply it by this scale factor;

 -  0.5 BTC `order_qty` will be entered as `0.5 * fractional_quantity_scale = 50000000`
 -  0.1 ETH `order_qty` will be entered as `0.1 * fractional_quantity_scale = 10000000`.

